 "notes": [
  "Starting cards as posted under 'START(5) (nope, no objective)': Tatooine: Slave Quarters, Heading For The Medical Frigate ('HFTMF'), Strike Planning, The Camp and Insurrection & Aim High; these count toward the 60. The three Effects all come out with Heading For The Medical Frigate, so no single starting Effect is singled out.",
  "No Defensive Shields are posted.",
  "Posted 'Tat Jabba s Palace' dested Tatooine: Jabba's Palace (Special Edition), the Light printing (the Jabba's Palace-set site is Dark); 'Tat Cantina' dested Tatooine: Cantina (Light); 'Tat Hutt Trade Route' dested Tatooine: Hutt Trade Route (Desert); 'JP AC' and 'JP Antechamber' dested Jabba's Palace: Audience Chamber and Jabba's Palace: Antechamber; 'Tat Mos Espa DB' dested Tatooine: Mos Espa Docking Bay.",
  "Posted 'Madine' dested General Crix Madine (the card Strike Planning fetches); 'Geezum (is the man)' dested Geezum; 'Obi-Wan, Padawan' dested Obi-Wan Kenobi, Padawan Learner; 'Shimi' dested Shmi Skywalker; 'Tawass Khaa' dested Tawss Khaa; 'Naked Threepio' dested Threepio With His Parts Showing; 'Artoo' dested Artoo (Jabba's Palace).",
  "Posted 'Luke with Saber', 'Chewie w/ blaster', 'Lando w/ axe' and 'Leia w/ gun' dested Luke With Lightsaber, Chewie With Blaster Rifle, Lando With Vibro-Ax and Leia With Blaster Rifle.",
  "Posted 'You Overestimate our chances' dested Don't Underestimate Our Chances (You Overestimate Their Chances is a Dark card); 'Weapon Levitaion' dested the Light Weapon Levitation (Jabba's Palace); 'Obi s saber' and 'Anikan s Saber' dested Obi-Wan's Lightsaber and Anakin's Lightsaber.",
  "The 'START(5) (nope, no objective)' header line was removed.",
  "The same card list was posted earlier on DeckTech as deck 19091, \"GEEZUM IS THE MAN (again)\" (25 September 2001)."
